# Raw PDFs: allow tracking directory structure but avoid committing massive PDFs
# You can commit small reference PDFs or use git-lfs if desired.
# Uncomment the line below to ignore all raw PDFs:
# papers/**/*.pdf
!papers/**/.gitkeep
